  "title": "Training-Free Image Editing for Fashion Industry: FashionRepose",
  "summary": "FashionRepose, a training-free pipeline, enables non-rigid pose adjustments for long-sleeve garments using diffusion models, while addressing industry-specific challenges like identity preservation and real-time performance. It leverages zero-shot methodology and avoids specialized training data, as demonstrated by its deployment in global fashion firms.",
  "facts": [
